        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-134887",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "(“Kodiak,” the “Company,” “we” or “our”) has developed a new technology platform, the Antibody Biopolymer Conjugate (“ABC”) platform, for retinal medicines.",
        "start_character": 75,
        "end_character": 231
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-134887",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-134887-76828e19cc3d9d4d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-134887",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In August 2020, we entered into a manufacturing agreement with Lonza for the clinical and commercial supply of the Company’s antibody biopolymer conjugate drug substance which included a custom-built manufacturing facility.",
        "start_character": 26810,
        "end_character": 27033
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-134887",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-134887-76828e19cc3d9d4d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-134887",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to advancing our pipeline, we have made progress in process development and commercial scale manufacturing, including the commissioning and regulatory approval of Ursus, our dedicated commercial-scale drug substance manufacturing facility that was custom-designed and built in collaboration with Lonza, a leading drug contract manufacturing firm.",
        "start_character": 7282,
        "end_character": 7640
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-134887",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-134887-76828e19cc3d9d4d",
