        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We additionally rely on data exclusivity, market exclusivity, and patent term extensions when available, and may seek and rely on regulatory protection afforded through orphan drug designations.",
